OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched 800 films in Covid, now
OL,4,AI direct them'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the coronavirus lockdown in
OL,7,F2020, Benjamin Williams, a lifelong
OL,8,Ffilm fan, watched 800 films.
OL,10,F"I just found the time. Plus, it was
OL,11,FCovid - I was bored," said the now
OL,12,F28-year-old, looking back.
OL,14,FHe started out with dreams of becoming
OL,15,Fan animator, inspired by films like
OL,16,FAvatar: The Last Airbender and Pokemon,
OL,17,Fbefore going on to study film at
OL,18,FHereford Sixth Form College, which
OL,19,F"opened a whole world" for him.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
