OL,3,GNEWSA'I watched 800 films in Covid, now
OL,4,AI direct them'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, from Malvern, has now
OL,7,Fdirected his own film and worked with
OL,8,Fthe likes of Marvel and, most recently,
OL,9,Fwas an assistant director on Apple TV's
OL,10,Fhit series, Slow Horses, starring
OL,11,Faward-winners Sir Gary Oldman and Dame
OL,12,FKristin Scott Thomas.
